==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is an [[Aku Altar (Enemy Base)|Aku Altar]].
*3 [[Teacher Bear]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
*25 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*4 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*5 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[One Horn]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is optimized for level 6 units. If you struggle, it may be worth waiting for earlier stages to become available and clearing those first.

Bring [[Crazed Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Macho Cat]], [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Cat]], [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Wall Cat]], [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Eraser]], [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Dragon Cat]] and [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Sexy Legs Cat]]. You can use [[Cat Combo]]s to increase the effectiveness of the [[Cat Cannon|Cannon]] or the damage of your cats if you want. Once the enemies are in front of the [[Cat Base]], start spamming Crazed Walls and the attackers, then add the other meatshields once [[Teacher Bear]] reaches your units. Use the regular Cat Cannon whenever it's charged. You will win easily even with level 2 cats.

